<title>UK: LB Schleswig-Holstein sets NZ$100 million bond.</title>
<headline>LB Schleswig-Holstein sets NZ$100 million bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Toronto Dominion.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDESBANK SCHLESWIG-HOLSTEIN</p>
<p> AMT    NZ$100 MLN    COUPON     6.50	MATURITY    07.AUG.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.875    PAY DATE    07.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.375     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 8.0 PCT FEB 2001</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
